I will stay by your side and protect you forever.

6
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,800
落ちた希望を拾って明日へ繋いでゆけば
If I pick up fallen hope and connect it to tomorrow,

7
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:53,000
絡まった歪んだ願いだってほぐれる
even tangled, distorted wishes will untangle.

8
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:57,000
光をかざして躊躇いを消した
